Dear Busisiwe Cele,

Warm greetings from Bushveld Timber with the November 2026 edition of our monthly customer newsletter.

Product news this month is our new stock of sustainably sourced pine decking boards and treated eucalyptus poles, now cut and ready at our yard. They are ideal for guesthouse walkways, garden benches and fencing, and our team is happy to advise on lengths, quantities and finishes.

Our seasonal tip as we move into summer is to reseal outdoor timber early before the heavy rains arrive. A light sand down and a fresh coat of oil will keep decks and seating looking neat for your visitors at Garden Route Guesthouse.

Thank you for your continued support. We appreciate having you as part of our customer community.

Kind regards
Marike Botha
Bushveld Timber

